polish(P1): fonts site-wide + continuous section num + loader/perf skip + SEO + quiz consolidate

Executes P1 of the Claude Opus polish & improvement plan (AgentRouter review).

P1-4 FONTS (real bug)
- Found: brand fonts (Satoshi/Clash Display) were NOT loading site-wide — the only
  Fontshare @import lived in legacy v4-design.css which is not linked; pages fell
  back to system-ui.
- Added Fontshare @import to new-design-system.css (single shared stylesheet) +
  api.fontshare.com preconnect to all public pages. Verified Clash Display loads
  (document.fonts) + woff2 200s.

P1-5 SECTION NUMBERING
- Homepage sections jumped 05 -> 07 -> 08 when the blog had no posts (section 06
  "Signals" was injected only if posts existed).
- Blog/06 section now ALWAYS renders with a styled empty-state ("Signals are quiet
  right now...") when no posts. Verified sequence is now 01-08 continuous.

P1-6 PERFORMANCE / LOADER
- Loader ~1.5s count animation now skipped on repeat visits (sessionStorage 'hl'):
  index.html + site.js both immediately mark done+loaded. Verified: repeat visit
  -> loader done at 100 instantly, body loaded, 0 errors.
- WebGL #field canvas now renders a static constellation on low-end devices
  (<480px wide or <=2 CPU cores) in addition to existing prefers-reduced-motion
  fallback - saves battery/CPU on mobile.

P1-7 SEO
- Injected schema.org Event JSON-LD (rich results) on the homepage from the live
  /api/events feed (upcoming events; @graph when >1). Verified parses + appears.
- Confirmed existing: distinct benefit-led meta descriptions on all sub-pages,
  twitter:card/title/description/image, robots.txt + sitemap.xml already correct.
  (twitter:site omitted - no confirmed X handle to cite.)

P1-8 QUIZ CONSOLIDATION
- Root quiz-interactive.html was an orphaned duplicate (no internal links, not in
  sitemap) competing with canonical quiz.html. Replaced with a 0s meta-refresh
  redirect + canonical + noindex to quiz.html. Member workshop quiz
  (members/quiz-interactive.html?event=N) is distinct and kept as-is.

Verified: all pages 200, 1 stylesheet, valid JSON-LD, devicePixelRatio fonts load,
0 JS errors, no external CDN. Chain: ff05bcd -> f62766d -> d9ea86e -> this.
